  "display_title": "I'm a Beast, Not a Bunny!",
  "description": "Born to a wolf-shifter and a lion-shifter, Chloe knows she'll be a predator like no other. So she's got no idea what to do when she one day shifts into… a bunny! Even worse, Chloe then realizes she’s also in a novel, one where her family’s to be killed due to a series of misunderstandings. Determined to save her parents, Chloe sets out to unravel the lies and bring peace to her family. But can Chloe uncover the truth while keeping her transformation unknown? Or will this bunny be bested by fate?\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
